OL,3,GNEWSADaughter of man killed by partner
OL,4,Ahopes campaign will encourage men to
OL,5,Aseek help
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe daughter of a man killed by his
OL,8,Fpartner hopes a new campaign raising
OL,9,Fawareness of domestic abuse against men
OL,10,Fwill encourage victims to seek help.
OL,12,FShannon McIlwaine's dad Tony Browne was
OL,13,Fmurdered in 2022.
OL,15,FHis partner Wiktoria Maksymowicz
OL,16,Fstabbed him as he lay sleeping in his
OL,17,Fbed. In 2024, she was handed a life
OL,18,Fsentence after pleading guilty to
OL,19,Fmurder.
OL,21,FShe will serve at least 14 years in
OL,22,Fjail.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
